    "standardized_narrative": "At 31 December 2018 the syndicate's opening gross claims outstanding was $1,542.5m. Aggregate prior-year development on gross claims (derived from the gross claims development table) shows a small net favourable development of approximately $2.0m (release). The syndicate also reports a net release from prior years of $42.8m (net of reinsurance), attributable primarily to Marine, Political Risk and Political Violence classes, partially offset by adverse movements in Property, Specialty and Treaty. The movement reflects favorable claims development overall, notwithstanding significant 2018 catastrophe and large loss activity (Hurricane Florence, Hurricane Michael, Typhoon Jebi, Papua New Guinea Earthquake and several large fires) which affected current year loss experience.",
